{
 "about": "The subject a token yields. Each case is one subject: a token of a client of testdata/realm-clients/token-subject-clients.json lacks a claim or carries an array in place of a string, and its requests ask conditions over subject.id, name, type, serviceAccount, scopes and roles. Needs those clients and the users of testdata/realm/token-subject-users.json in the parity realm; subjectClaims stops a request whose token carries other claims.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_",
 "standVersion": true,
